      "source": "Simple implementation of <a href=\"EntityPathResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.querydsl\"><code>EntityPathResolver</code></a> to lookup a query class by reflection and using the static field\nof the same type.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"EntityPathResolver.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.querydsl 中的接口\"><code>EntityPathResolver</code></a> 的简单实现，通过反射查找查询类并使用同类型的静态字段。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates an <code>EntityPath</code> instance for the given domain class.",
      "translation": "为给定的领域类创建 <code>EntityPath</code> 实例。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates an <code>EntityPath</code> instance for the given domain class. Tries to lookup a class matching the naming\nconvention (prepend Q to the simple name of the class, same package) and find a static field of the same type in\nit.",
      "translation": "为给定的域类创建 <code>EntityPath</code> 实例。尝试查找符合命名约定（在简单名称前添加 Q，并位于同一包中）的类，并在该类中查找相同类型的静态字段。",
      "count": 2
    },
